{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19240","headline":"詶皇甫十少尹暮秋久雨喜晴有怀见示 · 刘禹锡","name":"詶皇甫十少尹暮秋久雨喜晴有怀见示","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"雨余独坐卷帘帷，便得诗人喜霁诗。\n摇落从来长年感，惨舒偏是病身知。\n扫开云雾呈光景，流尽潢污见路岐。\n何况菊香新酒熟，神州司马好狂时。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘禹锡","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_19240.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19240","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}